<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All the gates are pearls assigned</l><l>In the city of gold,</l><l>And the street is gold refined</l><l>With foundations twelvefold.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>There life’s crystal river flows</l><l>With abundant supplies,</l><l>And the tree of life there grows</l><l>And all need satisfies.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God is there the great I AM</l><l>In that city of light;</l><l>God’s the light within the Lamb,</l><l>And there never is night.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
